x86_64-windows  a destructible local inside a `catch` handler is refused for this target: a handler is a funclet, and a cleanup there would be a funclet inside a funclet. Beside a `try` and inside its body both compile on this target since 2026-09-26 (local-try-states.cpp); the shape this case measures, which both Itanium targets compile since 2026-09-09, is the one Microsoft piece left.
